{"id":"5a733cd86a02168b","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-quadraticfeq.md","title":"Majority closure of false points characterizes quadratic DNF functions","display":"thm-quadraticfeq — Majority closure of false points characterizes quadratic DNF functions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-quadraticfeq","aliases":["27-thm-quadraticfeq"],"display":"thm-quadraticfeq — Majority closure of false points characterizes quadratic DNF functions","depends_on":["[[27-df-quadfunc]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§11.3.3 Theorem 11.5","source_printed_pages":"493–494","source_pdf_pages":"517–518","verification_status":"source-statement-and-pigeonhole-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-quadraticfeq"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-quadraticfeq</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-quadraticfeq — Majority closure of false points characterizes quadratic DNF functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"923be44c9742df37\" href=\"?note=923be44c9742df37\" title=\"27-df-quadfunc\">27-df-quadfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§11.3.3 Theorem 11.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"493–494"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"517–518"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-pigeonhole-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"923be44c9742df37\" href=\"?note=923be44c9742df37\" title=\"27-df-quadfunc\">27-df-quadfunc</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{maj}:(\\mathbb B^n)^3\\to\\mathbb B^n\">\\(\\mathrm{maj}:(\\mathbb B^n)^3\\to\\mathbb B^n\\)</span> 为下式定义的函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{maj}(x,y,z)_i\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\min\\{x_i,y_i\\},\\min\\{x_i,z_i\\},\\min\\{y_i,z_i\\}\\}\\quad(x,y,z\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ i\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{maj}(x,y,z)_i\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\min\\{x_i,y_i\\},\\min\\{x_i,z_i\\},\\min\\{y_i,z_i\\}\\}\\quad(x,y,z\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ i\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x,y,z\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\n\\left(f(\\mathrm{maj}(x,y,z))\\le f(x)\\vee f(y)\\vee f(z)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x,y,z\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\n\\left(f(\\mathrm{maj}(x,y,z))\\le f(x)\\vee f(y)\\vee f(z)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 11.5，印刷 pp.493–494／PDF pp.517–518。三个假点各反驳二文字项中的一个文字，至少一个文字被两点共同反驳，majority也反驳它。反向若素项至少三文字，把文字分成三非空块；每个少一块项都不是implicant，选三个假见证，它们的majority满足完整素项，违式。常量/一次项一并覆盖；次数始终指DNF项长度，不能替换为实多线性次数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-quadfunc","status":"resolved","id":"923be44c9742df37","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quadfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadfunc","status":"resolved","id":"923be44c9742df37","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$，$\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-quadfunc]]。$\\mathrm{maj}:(\\mathbb B^n)^3\\to\\mathbb B^n$ 为下式定义的函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{maj}:(\\mathbb B^n)^3\\to\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{maj}(x,y,z)_i\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\min\\{x_i,y_i\\},\\min\\{x_i,z_i\\},\\min\\{y_i,z_i\\}\\}\\quad(x,y,z\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ i\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall x,y,z\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\n\\left(f(\\mathrm{maj}(x,y,z))\\le f(x)\\vee f(y)\\vee f(z)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1711,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-quadraticfeq|thm-quadraticfeq — Majority closure of false points characterizes quadratic DNF functions]]"}],"outgoing":["923be44c9742df37"]}